<title>CHINA: Shanghai Dazhong Taxi interim net up.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Dazhong Taxi interim net up.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p> Turnover	280.805	vs	   213.27</p>
<p> Net profit     55.954	vs	   51.832</p>
<p> Earnings per share    0.34 yuan vs 0.316</p>
<p>Net assets per share  4.23 yuan (no comparative figure)</p>
<p>Note: Shanghai Dazhong Taxi Co is</p>
<p>the city's biggest taxi company.</p>
</text>
